ic Rate, establishing a positive relationship between the two variables.', 'perplexity': 1.1691748820760957, 'mean_token_prob': 0.896923928958321, 'corruption_type': 'motivation', 'min_prob': 0.19894418834534416, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0020368929888388214, 'prob_variance': 0.04309865022057142, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.8566420118600875, 'avg_nll': 0.15629827102393057}

